# [[Russian]] {{gloss|concerning the country, nationality}}

====Usage notes====
The word '''росси́йский''' emphasizes belonging to Russia, as a citizen or resident regardless of ethnicity, as opposed to {{m|ru|ру́сский}}, which indicates ethnicity, etc. In some cases the words may be used interchangeably.

